{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226770","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226770","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1422677001:1":{"text":"이미 세상을 많이 돌아다녀 봤다고 생각했는데, 셀로클랜드 같은 곳은 처음입니다...","source_cn":"我本以为游历四方后已经见识匪浅了。但从没见过萨洛克兰这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35732A3DCA8A25C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422677002:1":{"text":"건축 양식이 땅거미 숲과 완전 다르군요. 레오프론풍의 요소도 약간 보입니다.","source_cn":"这里的建筑风格和薄暮丛林完全不一样，倒是有一些耀光的感觉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x28AEDDE080A96C59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422677003:1":{"text":"셀로클랜드와 달리, 저희는 늘 나무와 더불어 살아왔기 때문에 자연의 흐름을 따라 건물을 짓거든요.","source_cn":"我们的居所都是与树木共生，随自然而建，并不像萨洛克兰这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA604E9BB80BFFE41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422677004:1":{"text":"셀로클랜드는 드워프들과 함께 건설한 도시라 그럴 겁니다.","source_cn":"萨洛克兰是由矮人一族协助建造的，可能这是原因之一吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02FE9D9664DF1519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422677005:1":{"text":"이렇게 웅장한 건... 질서와 경계를 표현한 것일지도 모르겠군요.","source_cn":"至于壮观……或许这也是一种秩序和界限的体现。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97685A5D1019961B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422677006:1":{"text":"질서와 경계라... 흥미롭군요. 땅거미 숲의 질서는 누가 정한 게 아니라, 자연 그 자체랍니다.","source_cn":"秩序和界限吗？有趣的说法。在薄暮丛林，我们的秩序是自然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FE79DC4CA76FC91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422677007:1":{"text":"하지만 셀로클랜드의 바뀐 모습과 여러분이 이전에 말씀하신 것을 떠올려 본다면.","source_cn":"不过，看到萨洛克兰现在的变化，再对比你们之前描述的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x164BBAB0030BBBAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422677008:1":{"text":"더 깊이 알아볼 기회가 없다는 점이 아쉽군요.","source_cn":"我只是有一些遗憾，不能再更深入地了解你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4338EFA858CF4AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422677009:1":{"text":"저도 이번에는 시험을 받는 입장이라 셀로클랜드를 제대로 소개해 드리지 못하는 게 아쉽군요.","source_cn":"这次考验在身上，不能带你好好浏览萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA53BAA82A13818F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422677010:1":{"text":"만약... 정말로 저주가 풀린다면 제가 직접 저희 고향을 안내해 드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"如果……诅咒真能解除，我一定会带着你好好看看我的家乡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21E0547AE3661CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"에이론","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":2}}